gstreamer_ros_babel_fish (vendored snapshot)
===========================================

Upstream: https://github.com/StefanFabian/gstreamer_ros_babel_fish
Commit:   01444de9f1d3ca5e1d830634572d800e005df33f (main, 2026-09-17)
License:  GNU Affero General Public License v3.0 (see LICENSE)

This tree is a snapshot of the upstream repository used to build
rbfimagesink in the capture-pipeline Kubernetes image. Docker COPY +
colcon; no git clone at image build.

Local changes (Humble / L4T r36, ROS 2 Humble):
- RosNodeInterface: SingleThreadedExecutor when rclcpp < 28 (Humble);
  EventsExecutor kept for newer distros. Drop EventsExecutor header
  from ros_node_interface.hpp.
- format_conversion.cpp: sensor_msgs encodings UYVY/YUYV mapped to
  Humble names YUV422 / YUV422_YUY2.
- CMakeLists.txt: omit benchmark executables (they still used
  EventsExecutor and failed to configure on Humble).
- test/ and benchmark/ directories omitted (image builds with
  -DBUILD_TESTING=OFF).
